---LINES
var     = ipv   -       -       -       -         "3.141593"
alt1    = ipa   -       -       -       -         "YES"
alt2    = ipa   -       -       -       -         "[x]"
mse     = ipm   -       -       -       -         " Quit "
VAR     = gv - - - - " VAR "
ALT     = ga - - - - " ALT "
MSE     = gm - - - - " MSE "

---SCREEN                                                          
=LINLIB generic keyboard command/actions
+
+                 ."on active line"..........        ."common".................
+.MSE. .mse....   menu item select:   .:SP...        get help:          .:HE... 
+                             select: .:NL...        exit/close page:   .:EX... 
+.ALT. .alt2.     alter or toggle,                   refresh page:      .:RE... 
+                            forward: .:SP...        cancel:            .:CA... 
+                           backward: .:DE...        next line:         .:TA... 
+.VAR. .var.....  switch to edit,                                              
+                       keep content: .:SP...        ."page navigation"........
+                              clear: .:DE...        jump to 1st line:  .:KH... 
+                                                         - last line:  .:KE... 
+."in edit mode"................ ."variant"..        next page/part:    .:PU... 
+toggle Ins/Ovr mode:    .:KI... .:PR .:PR...        prev page/part:    .:PD... 
+erase left from cursor: .:DE...                                               
+    erase below cursor: .:KD... .:PR .:DE...        ."special"................
+         erase up to end....... .:PR .:SP...        commit,            
+jump to 1st symbol:     .:KH... .:PR .:AL...          complete editing,          
+  jump to end of text:  .:KE... .:PR .:AR...            next line:     .:NL... 
+                                                    variant prefix:    .:PR... 
+                                                    
=LINLIB (c) 1986-1990,2020 vsv & team
---END                          

     
     
     
     
     
     
     
     
     
     
     
     
     
     
     
     
     
     
                                                                               

























































































